    "body": "## Motivation\n\n`MooncakeKVManager.register_buffer_to_engine()` and `_register_staging_memory()` ignore the return value of `batch_register()`. That wrapper logs nonzero status at debug level and converts backend exceptions into `-1`, so initialization can continue after memory registration fails.\n\n## Modifications\n\n- Raise on a nonzero batch registration status, matching single-region `register()`.\n- Preserve backend exceptions as the cause and retain the existing missing-API upgrade message.\n- Extend the existing registration fixture to exercise the real KV and staging callers with success and failure statuses.\n\n## Accuracy Tests\n\nUnmodified main (`44bc4788`): both caller subcases and the backend-exception regression fail. With the fix:\n\n```bash\nCUDA_VISIBLE_DEVICES=99 PYTHONPATH=python python -m pytest \\\n  test/registered/unit/disaggregation/test_encode_server.py \\\n  test/registered/unit/disaggregation/test_mooncake_transfer_batching.py \\\n  test/registered/unit/disaggregation/test_mooncake_custom_mem_pool_batch.py -q -rs\n```\n\n**81 passed, 39 subtests passed, 6 skipped.** The six existing gRPC tests skip because the optional `grpc_health` dependency is unavailable; all new registration cases run. The tests use the production wrapper and caller methods and inject failures only at the external Mooncake SDK boundary. GPU/RDMA end-to-end validation was not run.\n\n## Speed Tests and Profiling\n\nNot run; the success return remains `0` and buffer registration stays outside inference.\n\n## Checklist\n\n- [x] Format code with pre-commit: all applicable hooks passed on the two changed files.\n- [x] Add regression tests to the existing registered CPU fixture.\n- [ ] Update documentation: no new configuration.\n- [ ] Provide accuracy and speed benchmarks: GPU/RDMA model evaluation and performance benchmarks were not run.\n- [x] Follow SGLang code style.\n\nPrepared with Codex assistance; the baseline comparison, regression tests, and repository checks were run locally.\n\n<!-- pr-states:start -->\n---\n### CI States\n\nLatest PR Test (Base): <!-- slot:pr-test:start -->:x: [Run #38062041660](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/38062041660)<!-- slot:pr-test:end -->\nLatest PR Test (Extra): <!-- slot:pr-test-extra:start -->:x: [Run #38062041389](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/38062041389)<!-- slot:pr-test-extra:end -->\nLatest PR Test (AMD ROCm 10): <!-- slot:pr-test-amd:start -->:x: [Run #38062041508](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/38062041508)<!-- slot:pr-test-amd:end -->\n<!-- pr-states:end -->",
